<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Chennai to Bangalore | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure my car remains scratch‑free during the Chennai to Bangalore move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by a four‑step safety protocol: a joint pre‑load inspection, hydraulic ramp loading with soft‑rubber rollers, a 4‑wheel lock system, and custom edge padding for vulnerable panels. Real‑time GPS monitoring and trained crew further eliminate accidental contact, ensuring your vehicle arrives spotless.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What exact documents are required for RTO transfer when using packers and movers Chennai to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original registration certificate, insurance policy, valid PUC certificate, address proof for both cities, a signed delivery receipt, and the e‑Way bill generated by our team. Our specialists verify each paper during the joint inspection to avoid any statutory delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels from Chennai to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every carrier in our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location updates to our customer portal. You receive a secure link after loading, allowing you to monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any route adjustments instantly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are the moving charges calculated for car transport from Chennai to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges are based on vehicle size, distance, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and applicable GST. Our transparent cost table separates each element, so you see the base freight, fuel adjustment, statutory fees, and optional add‑ons like premium padding. No hidden fees are ever added.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory and what does the IRDAI‑approved coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While optional, we strongly recommend IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for full peace of mind. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards up to the declared value of your vehicle. Our team assists in declaring the correct value and filing any claim swiftly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time and how does traffic affect the Chennai‑Bangalore route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal conditions, the 377 km journey takes 7‑8 hours. Our route planning accounts for peak traffic on NH 16, especially near Chennai and Bangalore outskirts. We schedule departures during off‑peak windows and provide real‑time updates if unexpected congestion arises, ensuring timely delivery.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
